{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://github.com/happypathnetworking/fylgja/schemas/show.schema.json",
  "title": "fylgja twin show — the show block — M11 extension",
  "description": "The `show` block of the findings document `fylgja twin show --json` emits (operation twin.show). One document, from containerlab, the twin directory and the workflow service; every fact the text output reports, and no credential. M5: host.nodes[] gains artifact, the name and checksum twin.json records for the node, or null for a node the record does not name (an orphan’s, or a record that cannot be read). in_flight steps may be push. No artifact content. M7: host.nodes[] gains psp, the package id from twin.json, or null. M10: record gains waypoint, the waypoint twin.json 3 names, present only when the record names one; a 2 record shows none. The kind line for such a twin reads `pinned at <at>, waypoint <series>/<sequence>; not following`. M11: record gains state and step (the record's step block as twin show reads it: outcome, from, to, run, phase, restarted, pushed, timings, started_at, ended_at), present for a 4 record that has stepped; kind gains diverged, whose line names the target, the phase, the nodes landed and not, and fylgja twin destroy as the remedy; a stepped twin keeps kind pinned with a sentence naming the step; in_flight may list fylgja-step with its step. M12: record.step gains wait, the step's wait as twin show shows it: outcome, budget_s, reads, after_s and the failing assertions by rule and object (no message), or null while it has not run; absent for a 4 record. 014: record.waypoint becomes record.stage, the stage twin.json 6 names (its proposed change by id and branch, label, description, at_source), present only when the record names one; a 5 or earlier record shows none. The kind line reads `pinned at <at>, stage <branch>/<label>; not following`. record.step's sides carry stage where they carried waypoint. 015: record.rehearsal, the rehearsal run whose baseline the twin is, as twin.json 7 records it ({workflow_id, run_id}), present only when the record names one; a 6 or earlier record, or a 7 record of a twin no rehearsal built, shows none. in_flight may list fylgja-rehearse, its child the provision, step or destroy it has in flight, as a check's child is listed; the stage it is at is named by the text's in flight: line and by notes, not by the entry. 017: record.contract_version is gone, and record.scope and record.mapping ({reader, model, version}) carry twin.json 8's provenance, present for an 8 record that names a scope tag:<name> and a mapping twin.json 8 holds, and absent for a 7 or earlier one, which names neither, and for an 8 edited by hand to name a scope that is not tag:<name> or a mapping twin.json 8 cannot hold, which no build writes (T097, T106). The record line reads `record: <ref>, bundle_id <id>, schema <hash>, scope <scope>, read by <reader> from <model>@<version>`; `…, scope unknown (record <version>)` for a 7 or earlier record; `…, scope unknown (record 8 names scope \"fylgja\", not tag:<name>)` for an 8 whose scope is not tag:<name>; and `…, scope tag:fylgja, read by an unknown reader (record 8 names mapping reader \"Infrahub DCIM\")` for an 8 whose mapping twin.json 8 cannot hold, each field it fails named. 018: record.snapshot_id, required, the snapshot twin.json 9 names, or null for a 9 naming none and for a record of 8 or earlier; record.source gains snapshot, a twin twin create --snapshot built, whose kind is pinned or frozen by its envelope and never following, with the note `built from snapshot <id>`; record.step's sides carry snapshot_id when the record's step names one. The record line reads `record: <ref>, snapshot <id>, bundle_id <id>, schema <hash>, …`, with `snapshot none` for a 9 naming none and `snapshot none (record <version>)` for an earlier record.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "host",
    "kind",
    "service",
    "in_flight",
    "notes"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "host": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "lab_present",
        "twin_dir_present",
        "nodes",
        "phrase"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "lab_present": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "twin_dir_present": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "nodes": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "name",
              "container",
              "state",
              "mgmt_ipv4",
              "psp"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "name": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "container": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "state": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "mgmt_ipv4": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "artifact": {
                "type": [
                  "object",
                  "null"
                ],
                "description": "M5: from twin.json, by node name; null when the record does not name the node.",
                "required": [
                  "name",
                  "checksum"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "name": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "checksum": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{32}$"
                  }
                }
              },
              "psp": {
                "type": [
                  "string",
                  "null"
                ],
                "description": "M7: the node’s support package id as twin.json records it (nodes[].psp.id), or null for a node the record does not name (an orphan’s). No new key in twin.json."
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "phrase": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "HostState.Describe(): what the host holds, in M3's words; empty when it holds nothing"
        }
      }
    },
    "record": {
      "description": "twin.json, when present and readable; absent otherwise",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "branch",
        "snapshot_id",
        "bundle_id",
        "schema_hash",
        "observed_at",
        "source",
        "run",
        "worker_version",
        "recorded_at",
        "nodes"
      ],
      "dependentRequired": {
        "scope": [
          "mapping"
        ],
        "mapping": [
          "scope"
        ]
      },
      "properties": {
        "branch": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "at": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "verbatim, when the reference was pinned"
        },
        "snapshot_id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "description": "018: the snapshot the record names, as twin.json 9's snapshot_id; null for a 9 naming none and for a record of 8 or earlier, whose record line says (record 8)"
        },
        "bundle_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
        },
        "schema_hash": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "scope": {
          "type": "string",
          "pattern": "^tag:\\S+$",
          "description": "017: the scope the twin's read was made under, as twin.json 8's provenance.scope records it. Absent for a record of 7 or earlier, which names none, and for an 8 naming a scope that is not tag:<name> or a mapping twin.json 8 cannot hold, whose record line names it (T097, T106): present only beside mapping"
        },
        "mapping": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "017: the reader that produced the twin's CTM and the version of the model it read, as twin.json 8's provenance.mapping records them. Absent for a record of 7 or earlier, which names none, and for an 8 naming a scope that is not tag:<name> or a mapping twin.json 8 cannot hold, whose record line names it (T097, T106): present only beside scope",
          "required": [
            "reader",
            "model",
            "version"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "reader": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]*$"
            },
            "model": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            },
            "version": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "observed_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "observed_at_note": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "intent",
            "bundle",
            "snapshot"
          ]
        },
        "run": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "workflow_id",
            "run_id"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "workflow_id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "run_id": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "worker_version": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "recorded_at": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "nodes": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "stage": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "014: the stage the twin was created from or stepped to, as twin.json 6 records it (twin.schema.json). Absent when the record names none, and for a record of 5 or earlier",
          "required": [
            "proposed_change",
            "label",
            "description",
            "at_source"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "proposed_change": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "id",
                "branch"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "branch": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^[^/\\s]+$"
                }
              }
            },
            "label": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[^/\\s]+$"
            },
            "description": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "at_source": {
              "enum": [
                "given",
                "written",
                "branch_point",
                "head"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "rehearsal": {
          "type": [
            "object",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "015: the rehearsal run whose baseline the twin is, as twin.json 7 records it (twin.schema.json). Absent when the record names none, and for a record of 6 or earlier",
          "required": [
            "workflow_id",
            "run_id"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "workflow_id": {
              "const": "fylgja-rehearse"
            },
            "run_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "enum": [
            "ready",
            "diverged"
          ],
          "description": "M11: the record’s state; absent for a 3 record"
        },
        "step": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "M11: twin.json 4’s step block, as far as twin show shows it (twin.schema.json); absent when the record has no step",
          "required": [
            "outcome",
            "from",
            "to",
            "run",
            "restarted",
            "pushed",
            "started_at",
            "ended_at"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "outcome": {
              "enum": [
                "stepped",
                "unchanged",
                "diverged"
              ]
            },
            "from": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "stage",
                "bundle_id",
                "at"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "stage": {
                  "type": [
                    "object",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "description": "014: the side's stage, as twin.json 6's step block records it, or null",
                  "required": [
                    "proposed_change",
                    "label",
                    "description",
                    "at_source"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "proposed_change": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "required": [
                        "id",
                        "branch"
                      ],
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1
                        },
                        "branch": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "pattern": "^[^/\\s]+$"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "label": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^[^/\\s]+$"
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "at_source": {
                      "enum": [
                        "given",
                        "written",
                        "branch_point",
                        "head"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "snapshot_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
                  "description": "018: the side's snapshot, as twin.json 9's step block records it; absent when the side names none (the from side of a step from a record of 8)"
                },
                "bundle_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "at": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "to": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "stage",
                "bundle_id",
                "at"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "stage": {
                  "type": [
                    "object",
                    "null"
                  ],
                  "description": "014: the side's stage, as twin.json 6's step block records it, or null",
                  "required": [
                    "proposed_change",
                    "label",
                    "description",
                    "at_source"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "proposed_change": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "required": [
                        "id",
                        "branch"
                      ],
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1
                        },
                        "branch": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "pattern": "^[^/\\s]+$"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "label": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "pattern": "^[^/\\s]+$"
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "at_source": {
                      "enum": [
                        "given",
                        "written",
                        "branch_point",
                        "head"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "snapshot_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
                  "description": "018: the side's snapshot, as twin.json 9's step block records it; absent when the side names none (the from side of a step from a record of 8)"
                },
                "bundle_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "at": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "run": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "workflow_id",
                "run_id"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "workflow_id": {
                  "const": "fylgja-step"
                },
                "run_id": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            },
            "phase": {
              "enum": [
                "reconcile",
                "readiness",
                "push",
                "record"
              ]
            },
            "restarted": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "the reconcile’s restarted, recreated and added nodes"
            },
            "pushed": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "node",
                  "reasons",
                  "outcome"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "node": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "reasons": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "outcome": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "rule": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "took_s": {
                    "type": "number"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "timings": {
              "type": "object"
            },
            "started_at": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "ended_at": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "wait": {
              "type": [
                "object",
                "null"
              ],
              "description": "M12: twin.json 5's step.wait as twin show shows it; null while the wait has not run; absent for a 4 record",
              "required": [
                "outcome",
                "budget_s",
                "reads",
                "after_s",
                "failing"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "outcome": {
                  "enum": [
                    "settled",
                    "expired",
                    "cancelled",
                    "incomplete"
                  ]
                },
                "budget_s": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0
                },
                "reads": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0
                },
                "after_s": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "minimum": 0
                },
                "failing": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "rule",
                      "object"
                    ],
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "rule": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "object": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "kind": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "none",
        "pinned",
        "frozen",
        "from_bundle",
        "following",
        "diverged"
      ]
    },
    "following": {
      "description": "present when Schedule fylgja-follow exists, whatever the twin",
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "branch",
        "interval_s",
        "schedule_id"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "branch": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "interval_s": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 10
        },
        "schedule_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "const": "fylgja-follow"
        },
        "next_check_at": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "last_check": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/check"
        }
      }
    },
    "last_check": {
      "description": "when following stopped after a failed rebuild and no Schedule exists: the check that stopped it",
      "$ref": "#/$defs/check"
    },
    "in_flight": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "workflow_id",
          "run_id",
          "step"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "workflow_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "run_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "step": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "the step the run's history has reached, as findings name steps"
          },
          "child": {
            "description": "for a check: its child run in flight; for a rehearsal (015), fylgja-rehearse: its child in flight, its provision, a step or its destroy. The stage the rehearsal is at is not in the entry: the text's in flight: line and notes name it",
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "workflow_id",
              "run_id",
              "step"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "workflow_id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "run_id": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "step": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "service": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "ok",
        "unreachable"
      ]
    },
    "notes": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "description": "the statements the text prints: best-effort reproducibility for an unpinned twin; a rebuild discards runtime state; why the twin is not following; the remedy for an orphan or a stopped following"
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "check": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "workflow_id",
        "run_id",
        "scheduled_at",
        "outcome",
        "findings"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "workflow_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "run_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "scheduled_at": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "closed_at": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "outcome": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "unchanged",
            "rebuilt",
            "rejected",
            "error",
            "rebuild_failed",
            "skipped",
            "cancelled"
          ]
        },
        "step": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "twin_bundle_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bundle_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "findings": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "cleanup": {
          "type": "object",
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "required": [
            "teardown",
            "unstage",
            "remaining"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "teardown": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "unstage": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "removed": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "remaining": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
